      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YONDU BALE (1) is having his first start around this track. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 6 lengths (26.28) at Geelong. Ready to return to form. GO MY SWIFTY (6) box seated before sticking on well to finish a neck away in second (25.65) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 450m. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Expected to feature. VICE LIKE GRIP (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (25.75) at this track behind Cheeky Mila in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Bold showing expected. BIG COOL (5) flew the lids and led all the way last time. Big chance again.",
